<title>USA: W. Virginia jobless rate steady at 6.5 pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>W. Virginia jobless rate steady at 6.5 pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, W.Va. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Virginia's unemployment rate was 6.5 percent in September, unchanged from August, the state Bureau of Employment Programs said Thursday.</p>
<p>Wirt County had the state's highest unemployment rate, 17.4 percent, while Pendleton County had the lowest, 2.3 percent.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
